This is currently implemented in a similar fashion in Sporkhack; the
higher level a monster is, the more likely it will be able to resist the
'fear' effects of Elbereth on any given instance.  This leaves it still
somewhat useful as a means to cause fear, but prevents it from being the
"permanently safe" square.  (And also leaves it available to the
early-game characters who may not have found a lot of resources yet.)

